{
  "lessonId": "L2M1L2",
  "title": "Friuli Venezia Giulia 弗留利-威尼斯朱利亞",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085 0%,#1abc9c 100%)'><h1>🌿 Friuli Venezia Giulia</h1><p class='subtitle'>義大利白酒的聖地</p></section><section class='slide friuli-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='friuli-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='friuli-map' class='friuli-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌿 Friuli 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(22,160,133,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #16a085'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>義大利白葡萄酒的聖地，以 Collio 的 Ponca 土壤和橘酒運動聞名</p></div><h3 style='margin:0 0 25px;color:#fff;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid rgba(22,160,133,0.8);padding-bottom:12px'>圖例說明</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600'>🌍 大區邊界</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 0'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:rgba(22,160,133,0.15);border:3px solid #16a085;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>Friuli Venezia Giulia 大區範圍</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>👑 S級 DOC</h4><button onclick='zoomToFriuliRegion(&quot;Collio DOC&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(243,156,18,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #f39c12;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(243,156,18,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(243,156,18,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#f39c12;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#f39c12'>Collio DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Ponca土壤，Friuli最優質白酒產區</p></button></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #f39c12;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級 DOC/DOCG</h4><button onclick='zoomToFriuliRegion(&quot;Colli Orientali DOC&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(231,76,60,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e74c3c;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(231,76,60,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(231,76,60,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>Colli Orientali DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>精品產區，擁有Ramandolo & Rosazzo DOCG</p></button><button onclick='zoomToFriuliRegion(&quot;Ramandolo DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(155,89,182,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #9b59b6;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(155,89,182,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(155,89,182,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#9b59b6;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#9b59b6'>Ramandolo DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>Verduzzo甜白酒，義大利甜酒珍品</p></button><button onclick='zoomToFriuliRegion(&quot;Rosazzo DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(26,188,156,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #1abc9c;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(26,188,156,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(26,188,156,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#1abc9c;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#1abc9c'>Rosazzo DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>精品混釀白酒，Friulano主導</p></button></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#95a5a6;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #95a5a6;padding-bottom:8px'>💎 B級 DOC</h4><button onclick='zoomToFriuliRegion(&quot;Friuli Grave DOC&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(52,152,219,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #3498db;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(52,152,219,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(52,152,219,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#3498db;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#3498db'>Friuli Grave DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>產量最大，性價比高的日常餐酒</p></button><button onclick='zoomToFriuliRegion(&quot;Friuli Isonzo DOC&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(93,173,226,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #5dade2;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(93,173,226,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(93,173,226,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#5dade2;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#5dade2'>Friuli Isonzo DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>品質穩定的白酒產區</p></button><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-top:15px'><div style='width:12px;height:12px;background:#16a085;border-radius:50%;margin-right:8px'></div><span style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.9rem'>重要城市</span></div></div><div style='background:rgba(102,126,234,0.15);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin-top:5px;border:1px solid rgba(102,126,234,0.3)'><p style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem'>💡 地圖操作提示：</p><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);line-height:1.8;list-style:none'><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>🖱️ 滑鼠滾輪縮放地圖</li><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>🖐️ 拖曳移動視角</li><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>📍 點擊區域查看產區詳情</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ 東北邊境的葡萄酒寶庫</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Friuli Venezia Giulia（簡稱 Friuli）位於義大利東北角，與斯洛維尼亞接壤，是義大利<strong>白葡萄酒品質最高</strong>的產區之一。</p><div class='highlight-stats'><div class='stat-item'><span class='stat-number'>80%</span><span class='stat-label'>白葡萄酒產量</span></div><div class='stat-item'><span class='stat-number'>20%</span><span class='stat-label'>紅葡萄酒產量</span></div><div class='stat-item'><span class='stat-number'>43</span><span class='stat-label'>DOC 產區</span></div></div></div><div class='geography-info'><h4>🌍 地理特色</h4><ul><li><strong>位置：</strong>東北角，與斯洛維尼亞、奧地利接壤</li><li><strong>氣候：</strong>受 Adriatic 海洋調節 + 阿爾卑斯冷風</li><li><strong>土壤：</strong>Ponca（泥灰岩）、沖積土、石灰岩</li><li><strong>特色：</strong>多語言文化（義、德、斯洛維尼亞語）</li></ul></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 三大核心產區</h2><div class='sub-regions'><div class='sub-region collio'><div class='region-badge'>頂級</div><h3>Collio DOC</h3><div class='region-profile'><p><strong>位置：</strong>斯洛維尼亞邊境丘陵</p><p><strong>土壤：</strong>Ponca（泥灰岩 + 砂岩）</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>Friuli 最優質產區</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>複雜、礦物感、陳年潛力</p><p><strong>代表品種：</strong>Friulano, Ribolla Gialla, Pinot Grigio</p></div><div class='wine-note'>💎 Collio 的 Ponca 土壤賦予葡萄酒獨特的鹹鮮礦物感</div></div><div class='sub-region colli-orientali'><div class='region-badge'>精品</div><h3>Colli Orientali del Friuli DOC</h3><div class='region-profile'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Collio 北方丘陵</p><p><strong>土壤：</strong>泥灰岩、砂岩</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>白酒 + 甜酒 Picolit</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>優雅、果香、結構感</p><p><strong>代表品種：</strong>Friulano, Verduzzo, Picolit（甜酒）</p></div><div class='wine-note'>🍯 Picolit 是義大利最珍貴的甜白酒之一</div></div><div class='sub-region grave'><div class='region-badge'>親民</div><h3>Friuli Grave DOC</h3><div class='region-profile'><p><strong>位置：</strong>平原地帶</p><p><strong>土壤：</strong>沖積土、礫石</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>產量最大、價格友善</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清新、易飲、日常</p><p><strong>代表品種：</strong>Pinot Grigio, Friulano, Merlot</p></div><div class='wine-note'>💰 性價比最高的 Friuli 葡萄酒</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌟 Friuli 六大白葡萄品種</h2><div class='grape-collection'><div class='grape-card star'><h4>⭐ Friulano</h4><p class='grape-origin'>（前稱 Tocai Friulano）</p><p class='grape-flavor'><strong>風味：</strong>白桃、杏仁、白花、草本</p><p class='grape-structure'><strong>結構：</strong>中等酒體、中高酸度、獨特苦杏仁尾韻</p><p class='grape-status'><strong>地位：</strong>Friuli 的「白葡萄之王」</p></div><div class='grape-card'><h4>Pinot Grigio</h4><p class='grape-flavor'><strong>風味：</strong>礦物、白桃、蜂蜜、堅果</p><p class='grape-structure'><strong>結構：</strong>Friuli 版本比 Veneto 複雜、有深度</p><p class='grape-note'>Collio 的 Pinot Grigio 是義大利<strong>最優質</strong>版本</p></div><div class='grape-card'><h4>Ribolla Gialla</h4><p class='grape-flavor'><strong>風味：</strong>青蘋果、檸檬、礦物、白花</p><p class='grape-structure'><strong>結構：</strong>高酸度、清新脆口、陳年潛力佳</p><p class='grape-note'>古老品種，可釀造<strong>橘酒</strong>（皮接觸）</p></div><div class='grape-card'><h4>Malvasia Istriana</h4><p class='grape-flavor'><strong>風味：</strong>白花、蜂蜜、杏桃、香料</p><p class='grape-structure'><strong>結構：</strong>芳香、中等酒體、低到中等酸度</p><p class='grape-note'>來自 Istria 半島，風格獨特</p></div><div class='grape-card'><h4>Sauvignon Blanc</h4><p class='grape-flavor'><strong>風味：</strong>青草、醋栗、西番蓮果、礦物</p><p class='grape-structure'><strong>結構：</strong>高酸度、清新、國際風格</p><p class='grape-note'>Friuli 版本優雅內斂，不過於奔放</p></div><div class='grape-card special'><h4>🍯 Picolit</h4><p class='grape-origin'>（甜酒專用）</p><p class='grape-flavor'><strong>風味：</strong>蜂蜜、杏桃乾、柑橘皮、堅果</p><p class='grape-structure'><strong>結構：</strong>甜型、低產量、極珍貴</p><p class='grape-note'>被譽為「義大利的 Sauternes」</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍊 橘酒（Orange Wine）革命</h2><div class='orange-wine-section'><div class='orange-intro'><h3>🧡 橘酒的誕生地</h3><p>Friuli（尤其是 Oslavia 村）是現代<strong>橘酒運動</strong>的發源地。橘酒是用<strong>白葡萄</strong>釀造，但採用<strong>紅酒工藝</strong>（皮接觸）。</p></div><div class='orange-process'><h4>🔄 橘酒釀造流程</h4><div class='process-steps'><div class='step'><span class='step-num'>1</span><p>白葡萄破皮後<strong>不分離果皮</strong></p></div><div class='step-arrow'>→</div><div class='step'><span class='step-num'>2</span><p>連皮發酵<br><strong>數天到數月</strong></p></div><div class='step-arrow'>→</div><div class='step'><span class='step-num'>3</span><p>提取<strong>單寧、顏色、風味</strong></p></div><div class='step-arrow'>→</div><div class='step'><span class='step-num'>4</span><p>陳年、裝瓶<br>橙黃色澤</p></div></div></div><div class='orange-characteristics'><h4>🍷 橘酒特色</h4><ul><li><strong>顏色：</strong>琥珀色、橙黃色、銅色</li><li><strong>風味：</strong>乾果、堅果、香料、茶葉、蜂蜜</li><li><strong>口感：</strong>有單寧、結構感強、酒體飽滿</li><li><strong>配餐：</strong>適合濃郁料理（咖哩、燉菜、熟成起司）</li></ul></div><div class='orange-pioneers'><h4>🌟 橘酒先驅</h4><p><strong>Josko Gravner:</strong> 橘酒革命之父<br><strong>Stanko Radikon:</strong> 自然酒運動領袖<br><strong>Damijan Podversic:</strong> 極端派代表</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📊 Friuli 產區品質階梯</h2><div class='quality-pyramid'><div class='pyramid-level top'><div class='level-label'>頂級</div><div class='level-content'>Collio DOC（單一園）<br>Colli Orientali DOCG Picolit<br>橘酒精品</div><div class='level-price'>€€€€</div></div><div class='pyramid-level high'><div class='level-label'>優質</div><div class='level-content'>Collio DOC<br>Colli Orientali DOC</div><div class='level-price'>€€€</div></div><div class='pyramid-level mid'><div class='level-label'>良好</div><div class='level-content'>Friuli Isonzo DOC<br>Friuli Aquileia DOC</div><div class='level-price'>€€</div></div><div class='pyramid-level base'><div class='level-label'>日常</div><div class='level-content'>Friuli Grave DOC</div><div class='level-price'>€</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 Friuli 白酒配餐</h2><div class='pairing-section'><div class='pairing-match'><h4>🌿 Friulano</h4><ul><li>🧀 San Daniele 生火腿（當地特產）</li><li>🐟 烤海鱸魚</li><li>🥗 蘆筍沙拉</li><li>🍝 奶油義大利麵</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-match'><h4>🍇 Ribolla Gialla</h4><ul><li>🦪 生蠔、貝類</li><li>🐟 清蒸魚</li><li>🥗 柑橘沙拉</li><li>🍤 檸檬蝦</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-match'><h4>🧡 橘酒（Orange Wine）</h4><ul><li>🍛 咖哩料理</li><li>🧀 洗浸起司（臭起司）</li><li>🥘 摩洛哥燉菜</li><li>🍖 烤豬肉</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-match'><h4>🍯 Picolit</h4><ul><li>🍰 杏桃塔</li><li>🧀 藍紋起司</li><li>🥜 堅果甜點</li><li>🍫 白巧克力慕斯</li></ul></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Friuli 是義大利白葡萄酒品質最高的產區</div><div class='point'>✓ Collio 的 Ponca 土壤賦予獨特礦物感</div><div class='point'>✓ Friulano 是 Friuli 的「白葡萄之王」</div><div class='point'>✓ Friuli 是現代橘酒運動的發源地</div><div class='point'>✓ Picolit 是義大利最珍貴的甜白酒</div><div class='point'>✓ 產區分級：Collio > Colli Orientali > Grave</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:25px}.intro-text p{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.highlight-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.stat-item{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#a8e6cf);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center}.stat-number{display:block;font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#16a085;margin-bottom:5px}.stat-label{display:block;font-size:.9rem;color:#555}.geography-info{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.geography-info h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.2rem}.geography-info ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.geography-info li{color:#2c3e50}.geography-info strong{color:#16a085}.sub-regions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.sub-region{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);position:relative;padding-top:45px}.region-badge{position:absolute;top:-12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#27ae60;color:#fff;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:25px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700}.sub-region h3{margin:0 0 15px;text-align:center;font-size:1.3rem;color:#2c3e50}.region-profile p{margin:10px 0;padding:8px 12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8f9fa,transparent);border-left:4px solid #16a085;line-height:1.6;font-size:.95rem}.region-profile strong{color:#2c3e50}.wine-note{margin-top:15px;padding:12px 15px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff9e6,#ffeaa7);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f39c12;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#2c3e50}.grape-collection{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.grape-card{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:4px solid #16a085}.grape-card.star{border-color:#f39c12;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e6,#fff)}.grape-card.special{border-color:#e74c3c;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fef3e0,#fff)}.grape-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.2rem}.grape-origin{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:.9rem;colo